#: crates/glint-ui/src/components/settings/agents.rs
msgid ""
"AI agents that speak the Model Context Protocol can ask Glint to find files "
"by name on every drive in milliseconds (with instant search on), measure "
"folders (as a map, in agents that show apps), list the biggest files, say "
"what was moved or deleted lately, search text inside files and read the "
"labels, tags and comments you gave files."
