#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"{agent} is on this PC. Through Glint it can search every drive in "
"milliseconds, size folders and tidy up, asking you before it changes "
"anything."
msgstr "{agent} 在此电脑上。通过 Glint，它可在毫秒级搜索每个驱动器、测量文件夹并整理，更改任何内容前都会询问你。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid "Connect it"
msgstr "连接它"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid "Glint follows XYplorer. Settings → Files has the switch."
msgstr "Glint 跟随 XYplorer。设置 → 文件 中有开关。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Glint stays in the tray when its window closes. Settings → Quick search "
"changes it."
msgstr "Glint 窗口关闭后保留在托盘中。设置 → 快速搜索 可更改。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Glint starts with Windows, in the tray. Settings → Quick search changes it."
msgstr "Glint 随 Windows 启动，位于托盘中。设置 → 快速搜索 可更改。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid "Glint follows Windows' light and dark mode"
msgstr "Glint 跟随 Windows 的浅色和深色模式"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Folder history is shared with zoxide. Settings → History has the switch."
msgstr "文件夹历史与 zoxide 共享。设置 → 历史 中有开关。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Copies and moves go through Glint's queue from now on. Settings → Files "
"changes it."
msgstr "从现在起复制和移动通过 Glint 的队列进行。设置 → 文件 可更改。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid ""
"Glint asks before moving anything to the Recycle Bin. Settings → Files "
"changes it."
msgstr "Glint 在将任何内容移到回收站前会询问。设置 → 文件 可更改。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid "1 photo or video"
msgstr "1 张照片或视频"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/mod.rs
msgid "{n} photos and videos"
msgstr "{n} 张照片和视频"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Renaming them one by one?"
msgstr "逐个重命名它们？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"Select several and press F2: Batch rename numbers them, swaps words and "
"shows every new name before anything changes."
msgstr "选择多个并按 F2：批量重命名会编号、替换文字，并在任何更改前显示每个新名称。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Rename these {n}…"
msgstr "重命名这 {n} 个…"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Always move {kind} files to “{to}”?"
msgstr "始终将 {kind} 文件移到“{to}”？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"That is {n} times from “{from}”. A folder rule does it by itself, and shows "
"what it would move before you turn it on."
msgstr "那是 {n} 次从“{from}”。文件夹规则可自动完成，并在开启前显示将移动的内容。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Make it a rule…"
msgstr "设为规则…"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Back and forth between two folders?"
msgstr "在两个文件夹之间来回？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"Put “{a}” and “{b}” side by side: drag across, or press F6 to go from one to "
"the other."
msgstr "将“{a}”和“{b}”并排：拖动跨越，或按 F6 从一个到另一个。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Open two panes"
msgstr "打开双窗格"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Long copies can wait their turn"
msgstr "长时间的复制可以排队等待"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"Glint's own queue copies one after another, can pause and go on, and checks "
"every copy against its original."
msgstr "Glint 自身的队列逐个复制，可暂停和继续，并将每个副本与其原始文件核对。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Use the copy queue"
msgstr "使用复制队列"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Deleted by accident?"
msgstr "误删了？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Glint can ask before it moves anything to the Recycle Bin."
msgstr "Glint 可在将任何内容移到回收站前询问。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Ask first"
msgstr "先询问"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Just having a look?"
msgstr "只是看看？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"Space shows a file without opening its app, and the arrow keys walk through "
"the others."
msgstr "空格在不打开其应用的情况下显示文件，方向键可浏览其他文件。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Show me"
msgstr "展示给我"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Make the labels yours"
msgstr "打造你自己的颜色标签"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"Red can be Urgent and Green can be Done: rename them, recolor them, add your "
"own. Alt+1 to Alt+9 follow their order."
msgstr "红色可以是“紧急”，绿色可以是“完成”：重命名、改色、添加你自己的。Alt+1 到 Alt+9 按它们的顺序。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Name the labels"
msgstr "命名颜色标签"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Find it again by its tag"
msgstr "按标签再次找到它"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"{query} in the search box finds everything tagged like this, on every drive "
"with instant search. label: and comment: work the same way."
msgstr "在搜索框中输入 {query} 可在开启即时搜索的每个驱动器上找到所有如此标记的内容。label: 和 comment: 用法相同。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Find them"
msgstr "找到它们"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Find it again by its comment"
msgstr "按注释再次找到它"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"A word of the comment in the search box finds the file, and has:comment "
"lists everything you wrote a note on."
msgstr "搜索框中输入注释的一个词即可找到文件，has:comment 列出你写过备注的所有内容。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Show “{name}” in the Gallery?"
msgstr "在图库中显示“{name}”？"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"{n} here. The Gallery shows your photos and videos as one grid, newest "
"first, and this folder isn't in it yet."
msgstr "此处有 {n} 个。图库将你的照片和视频显示为一个网格，最新在前，而此文件夹尚未加入。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Add to the Gallery"
msgstr "添加到图库"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "“{name}” isn't in your Gallery"
msgstr "“{name}”不在你的图库中"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid ""
"{n} are in {folder}. Add the folder and they show here with the rest, newest "
"first."
msgstr "{n} 个在 {folder} 中。添加该文件夹后，它们会与其余一起显示在此，最新在前。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Windows went dark"
msgstr "Windows 转为深色"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "Windows went light"
msgstr "Windows 转为浅色"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/suggestions/moments.rs
msgid "“{name}” is in the Gallery. Settings → Files lists its folders."
msgstr "“{name}”在图库中。设置 → 文件 列出其文件夹。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Glint {version} is ready"
msgstr "Glint {version} 已就绪"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "It installs when you quit Glint. Open Glint to restart now."
msgstr "它会在你退出 Glint 时安装。打开 Glint 立即重启。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Glint {version} is available"
msgstr "Glint {version} 可用"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Open Glint to install it."
msgstr "打开 Glint 安装它。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Open Glint to update it through Scoop."
msgstr "打开 Glint 通过 Scoop 更新它。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Open Glint to download it."
msgstr "打开 Glint 下载它。"

#: crates/glint-ui/src/updater.rs
msgid "Version {version} is ready. Installing it restarts the app."
msgstr "版本 {version} 已就绪。安装它会重启应用。"

